## How ordering works

1. Open Figurine Studio and upload a clear, well-lit photo of the person, couple, family or pet.
2. Pick one of two free AI design previews.
3. Request changes as many times as you like. Revisions before approval are free.
4. Choose a size (13, 15 or 18 cm), add optional base text, and pay through Shopify checkout.

WhatsApp is also available as a fallback: send your photos on WhatsApp and we design the figurine for you.

## Custom figurine facts

- Sizes: 13 cm (standard, base price), 15 cm (+₹1,000), 18 cm (+₹2,000).
- Material: premium PLA+ filament, 3D printed and hand-finished in-house in Bangalore.
- Colours: solid colours only (no gradients or photo-like shading), up to 5 colours per figurine.
- Base text: optional custom text on the base, entered when ordering.
- Design previews and revisions: free until you approve a design. You pay only when you order.
- What's included: one finished figurine on its base, packed for shipping.
- Turnaround: made and dispatched within 7 days of order confirmation, then 2–5 business days in transit depending on location. These are estimates, not guarantees.

