## Shipping

- Ships from Bangalore to addresses across India.
- Shipping: ₹100 per order, free on orders of ₹4,000 or more (every custom figurine ships free).
- Dispatch within 7 days of order confirmation; 2–5 business days in transit.
- Tracking details are shared once the order ships.
- Urgent orders (delivery needed in under 10 days) may need express shipping at an extra charge, quoted per order. Confirm any fixed deadline with us in writing before ordering.
- Full policy: https://everything3dindia.com/policies/shipping-policy

## Cancellation and refunds

- Design previews are free; nothing is charged until you approve a design and pay.
- Cancel before printing starts (usually within 24 hours of the order): full refund.
- Cancel after printing starts, before dispatch: ₹2,000 per figurine production fee is deducted.
- After dispatch: orders cannot be cancelled.
- Defects (missing person, wrong text, wrong size, wrong colour, transit damage) are reprinted and reshipped free if reported within 48 hours of delivery with photos.
- The approved design is the agreement: approving a render means you accept the likeness.
- Refunds go to the original payment method within 5–7 business days.
- Full policy: https://everything3dindia.com/policies/refund-policy

